toolbox/seawater/
=================

visc.m
------
The original CSIRO SEAWATER Library v2.0.1 (EOS-80/PSS-78) used to be
vendored here in full. As of the sw_->gsw_/TEOS-10 migration (branch
epsilon_processing), everything from that library has been removed except
visc.m (kinematic viscosity - restored to its original, pre-CSIRO name;
see visc.m's own header), which itself no longer calls any CSIRO code -
its density term was switched to the vendored gsw_rho.m below, so its
former sw_dens.m/sw_dens0.m/sw_seck.m/sw_smow.m dependency chain is gone
too. Nothing in this repo calls into the CSIRO toolbox anymore - see
docs/concepts/units_and_seawater.md.

ktemp.m
-------
Thermal diffusivity (GSW-backed density/heat capacity, plus a ported
Caldwell 1974 thermal-conductivity term with no GSW equivalent) - same
"pure seawater-property math, no metadata argument" shape as visc.m, so
it lives here too. Originally processing/scans/mod_scan_thermal_diffusivity.m;
moved and renamed here 2026-09-08.

gsw/
----
The full vendored GSW (Gibbs SeaWater) Oceanographic Toolbox, TEOS-10,
v3.06.16 - unmodified third-party code (https://www.teos-10.org/). This
is the toolbox every other seawater-property calculation in this repo
uses. See gsw/Contents.m for the toolbox's own index, and this
directory's Contents.m for addpath requirements and a known upstream bug
in gsw_deltaSA_atlas.m/gsw_SAAR.m.
